{#-
  LCARS Inspired Website Template by www.TheLCARS.com, with modifications.
  Migrated to the V26 "Classic" theme. V26 stylesheets are only compatible with
  V26 HTML structure, so the markup below follows LCARS-26/classic.html:
    - panels and nav are <button> (V23-B used <div>/<a>)
    - the data cascade is column-based (.data-column > .dc-row-N)
    - scroll-to-top is #topBtn inside .left-frame, driven by assets/lcars.js
    - <footer> is a sibling of <main>, not nested inside it
    - .headtrim / .baseboard close out the body

  Sounds: the stock V26 template wires every button to playSoundAndRedirect().
  This site has never shipped the LCARS audio, so decorative panels are inert
  and navigation uses plain hrefs. To enable audio, copy the beep*.mp3 files
  from the V26 package, add the <audio> elements, and swap the handlers back.
-#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ meta.lang }}">

<head>
